[TEXT] 🎯 **Root cause found!**

PC1's DNS is configured with `nameserver 10.5.0.4` (= srv1). The DNS response is:
```
status: REFUSED
WARNING: recursion requested but not available
Got recursion not available from 10.5.0.4
```

The DNS server at 10.5.0.4 is **refusing recursive queries** — `REFUSED`. Without working DNS, browsers can't resolve any hostname, so "web pages time out" even though ICMP to direct IPs works fine. This is the real fault. Entering the matching skill:
